    "eventContactName": "Gianna Scarpetti",
    "eventDetail": "You are invited to Stryker's Infrared Illumination System (IRIS) Ureteral Stent Placement Course led by world renowned MIS surgeon, Dr. Steven McCarus in Winter Park, FL. Our two-day course includes a preceptorship dinner tailored to the exploring the use of infrared lighted ureteral stents. In addition, you will have the opportunity to learn more about the placement of lighted ureteral stents and cystoscopy in live surgery observation as well as in a hands-on cadaveric lab.&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\nUpon completion of this course you will receive certification from Dr. McCarus himself acknowledging your understanding of diagnostic and operative cystoscopy with passage of ureteral stents.",
